<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Cigar raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Cigar raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Thursday it raised its rating on the shares of Consolidated Cigar Holdings Inc to a strong buy from an outperform.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The company reported second quarter earnings of $0.43 per share compared with $0.28 per share. It said premium cigars were behind the growth in sales during the second quarter, and it expected th trend to continue.</p>
<p>-- The stock gained 1-5/8 to 30.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
